title: Handokdang Conference
subtitle: The Handokdang chooses their new leader...
view-if: year = 1945 and month = 7 and handokdang_party_leader = "Cho So-Ang"
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true

= Handokdang Conference

# reference: Evans, Ellen L. “Adam Stegerwald and the Role of the Christian Trade Unions in the Weimar Republic.” The Catholic Historical Review 59, no. 4 (1974): 602–26.

4th Handokdang party conference will be held in this year, and it's time to re-elect party leader. 

The consensus candidate on the right is Kim Koo, one of leaders of the Provisional Government establishment. On the other hand, there is Cho So-Ang, former leader of Handokdang, who has been more supportive of cooperation with the left parties in the Provisional Assembly. He may be more friendly toward our party. 

- @kim: The Handokdang elects Kim Koo as the party chair.
- @cho: Influence the Handokdang to select Cho So-Ang as the party chair.
- @cho_campaign: We must hold a campaign in support of Cho So-Ang as party chair.

@kim
on-arrival: handokdang_party_leader = "Kim Koo"; handokdang_relation -= 5

Kim Koo has been selected as the chairman of the Handokdang. He will surely lead a rightward turn from Cho, and will preside over a Handokdang less inclined to compromise with the left.

@cho
unavailable-subtitle: Our relations are not good enough.
subtitle: Cho is likely to be friendlier to us than Kim.
choose-if: handokdang_relation >= 70
on-arrival: handokdang_party_leader = "Joos"; catholics_spd += 5; workers_z += 3

With our grassroots connections, we have been able to influence the Center delegates to support Joseph Joos as the new Center chairman. He has long been a friend of the SPD, and will be more inclined to collaborate with us compared to Kaas. He also increases the appeal of the Handokdang to the working class.

@cho_campaign
choose-if: handokdang_relation >= 62 and resources >= 1 
view-if: handokdang_relation < 70
unavailable-subtitle: [? if handokdang_relation <= 62 : Our relations are not good enough. ?] [? if resources < 1 : We do not have enough resources. ?]
subtitle: -1 resource. Cho is likely to be friendlier to us than Kim.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; handokdang_party_leader = "Joos"; catholics_spd += 5; workers_z += 3

With our grassroots connections as well as a professional campaign, we have been able to influence the Center delegates to support Cho So-Ang as the new Handokdang chairman. He is a socialdemocrat, and will be more inclined to collaborate with us compared to Kim. He also increases the appeal of the Handokdang to the working class.
